      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKSTAR QUALITY (8) has had two runs this campaign without filling a placing. Was again unable to find the frame last start when he finished eighth over 2185m at Pinjarra, beaten 14 metres. Has the class to take care of this field. CHIEF COPY (7) finished 11th last start over 2130m at Gloucester Park, beaten 12 metres, after a modest sixth at Gloucester Park the run prior. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Perfectly placed and is sure to play a major role. WELLOILED (4) should be at her peak for this. Finished second over 2050m at Collie at the latest appearance five days ago. Sure to give the top fancies plenty to think about. LUZIA (5) disappointed last time but is a chance based on a good second over 2130m at Central Wheatbelt two runs back.",
